      "content": "That's a great start, really nice tone. I think we can push the \"luxury\" feel even further though. \n\nThe editor just checked the preview and said the \"Descriptive Richness\" score was a bit lower than what we usually see for homepage features. They want it to feel even more \"maximalist\" in its descriptions. \n\nCan you rewrite that paragraph? Try to use even more descriptive language and more adjectives to really paint the picture—just make sure it still flows well and reads like high-end travel journalism. I don't want it to look like you're just trying to game the SEO tool, but we definitely need that score to go up so we don't get buried on the site.",
